// Test: error.duplicate-sanitized-name
// --- file: example.test.maxon
test 'adds two'
	print("first")
end 'adds two'

test 'adds-two'
	print("second")
end 'adds-two'

// --- file: main.maxon
function main() returns ExitCode
	return 0
end 'main'
---
CompilerError:
error E3107: <fragment>:7:6: duplicate test name: 'adds two' and 'adds-two' both compile to '__test_adds_two'
